{"author":{"id":"89da5fec8eff6d69dbcdd68f81be7e9163b16f34b17e978ecf3554487379f453"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1774029061,"nonce":"QPJbRScnLu9McVKl4785gl5h2fs=","title":"P7: wt-merge status updates + auth request auto-collect child issues","message":"Parent: f3dbb3e\nDepends on: 8a281b3 (P4 — work-unit API)\n\n## wt-merge updates (~/.dotfiles/bin/wt-merge)\n- After successful merge of child → parent: POST /api/work-units/merge { branch: child_branch }\n- Updates work unit state to merged, sets resolved_at\n- Non-fatal if Mandible unreachable (log warning, proceed)\n- NOTE: wt-merge is in dotfiles repo\n\n## mandible auth request auto-collect (~/.dotfiles/bin/mandible or cli/auth-request.sh)\n- When submitting auth request for an integration branch:\n  - Query Mandible: GET /api/work-units?branch_prefix=\u003cintegration_branch\u003e__ to find child work units\n  - Auto-collect their issue IDs\n  - Append to --issue flags (deduplicating against explicitly passed --issue args)\n- This means the orchestrator no longer needs to manually list every --issue for child partitions\n- Non-fatal if Mandible unreachable (fall back to explicit --issue flags only)\n- NOTE: auth-request is in dotfiles repo","files":null}]}